  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to victims of repressions in Belarus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective is to provide support to the victims of repressions in Belarus. This support includes medical aid and rehabilitation, financial support, and psychological counselling. The Danish support will contribute to provision of medical and psychological rehabilitation to released political prisoners located inside Belarus and the provision of small living stipends as systematic support to families of political prisoners in jail.</narrative>
  </description>
